{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JPXY3WmWFeyl8E3EPNFflg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:20.346184+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JPXY3WmWFeyl8E3EPNFflg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>为选拔具备交叉化学术志趣、突出科研潜质与综合发展潜力的优秀应届本科生，提升我院推免研究生生源质量，依托国内首个科技伦理学二级学科博士点建设，面向全国实施2026年优秀本科生选拔计划（以下简称“优本计划”），具体安排如下。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><strong><span>一、招生专业</span></strong></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><strong><span>硕士：1202Z1科技伦理学</span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span>直博生：1202Z1科技伦理学</span></strong></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><strong><span>二、申请条件</span></strong></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.全国高校2027届全日制应届本科生，品德端正、身心健康，预计可获得所在学校推免资格；</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span>对科技与人文交叉研究具备浓厚兴趣，专业基础扎实，有论文、课题、社会实践等相关科研实践经历者优先；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>英语水平达标：CET-6≥425 分，或雅思、托福、GRE达到总分60%及以上。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><strong><span>三、申请材料</span></strong></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>个人简历；</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>身份证正反面、学生证注册页合并扫描件；</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>前五/六学期教务盖章成绩单及专业排名证明，须由本科所在学校或院系教务部门盖章；</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>科研成果、获奖证书、英语证书、专家推荐信等支撑材料；</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>《电子科技大学研究生招生考生诚信复试承诺书》（见附件，请上传本人签字后的扫描件）。</span></span></p><p><span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JPXY3WmWFeyl8E3EPNFflg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：电子科技大学研究生招生考生诚信复试承诺书.doc</a></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>全部材料按顺序合并为单个PDF，命名：硕士/直博+科技伦理学+本科院校+姓名。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><strong><span>四、申请程序</span></strong></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.  网上申报（即日起—9月4日14:00）</span></p><p><span>登录研招报名系统https://yzbm.uestc.edu.cn/logon，按系统提示填写相关信息（批次选择“优本计划”），上传完整材料。</span></p><p><span>学院设直博生选拔专场，有意申请者请在报名时勾选“直博”选项。</span></p><p><span>2.  资格审核与复试确认</span></p><p><span>文研院综合学业、科研背景择优筛选入围。审核通过的学生请加入“优本计划”QQ群（群号随审核结果在系统中发布），后续面试通知将通过文研院官网及QQ群同步推送。面试时间拟定于9月中旬。</span></p><p><span>申请人可登录电子科技大学研究生招生管理信息系统查看审核状态，通过者须在规定的截止时间前确认是否参加复试。逾期未确认者，视为自动放弃资格。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><strong><span>五、选拔考核</span></strong></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>考核总分300分，总分及单科均需达60%合格线方可通过。</span></p><p><span>1.  英语测试（100分，约5分钟）：英文问答考察口语、学术阅读与专业翻译能力；</span></p><p><span>2.  综合测试（200分，约15分钟）：随机抽取交叉学科试题，重点考察科技伦理、科技哲学、语言认知、数理经济、数字社会相关专业基础、科研创新思维、跨学科视野与综合素养。同步完成思想政治品德考核，学术造假、品德不合格直接取消资格。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><strong><span>六、选拔结果使用</span></strong></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>成功入选且后续取得本校推免资格、在国家推免系统第一志愿填报我院对应专业的学生，文研院优先予以拟录取；推免生源将主要从优本计划入选者中选拔。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><strong><span>七、咨询渠道</span></strong></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>学院官网：https://aihss.uestc.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>咨询邮箱：aihss@uestc.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>咨询电话：028-61838791</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><strong><span>八、其他说明</span></strong></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.  推免最终规则以教育部、电子科技大学当年正式文件为准；</span></p><p><span>2.  考核全程遵守校院管理规定，入选名单仅在学院官网公示，未入围不再单独通知；</span></p><p><span>3.  本办法由人文社科高等研究院负责解释，自发布之日生效。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"微信图片_2025-05-21_152008_022.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/BX5mbEgdCNW853sicRENIK9iboicCwqziaXwlDqVe0XXTVg7wcicM1KVBAl1ibWUtHOPPSxC7f3ibwkVlOfFJA3I2SBh0vhMmB63GsMrf7fQ5vGA3s/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"ba0e429280153fa2e030bc39e9bd128f2f15fcd7afdf5a60367af3cfcfad05d5","textLength":1225,"sourceSha256":"3000d285941f28dc74374dba8ff47be923e0ece760eca39c73d5a9f9896ebc47","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-3875e9b62fdefdd7d127","title":"2026年电子科技大学人文社科高等研究院2026年“优秀本科生选拔计划”报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:20.346184+00:00"}
